add('08_Dock','DOCK','MASTER','Bellheart Dock master','SM_BH_Dock,BP_BH_Skiff','Lowest south tip, 4m wide oak pier, east skiff berth, rope rails and posts, cargo, lanterns, two small fishing platforms. Clear north arrival path rises to pond and distant tower. Aerial close view.')
add('08_Dock','DOCK','ARRIVAL_AND_RETURN','Dock arrival and reverse sightlines','L_Bellheart,SM_BH_Dock','Two matched eye-level views: looking north from dock up arrival path to pond/tower; looking south back from island to dock and eastern skiff berth. Preserve layout.')
add('09_GiantTree','GIANTTREE','MASTER','Lantern tree master','SM_BH_GiantTree','17m tall,20m broad crown,2.8m trunk with three spreading boughs, dense layered broad leaf masses, hanging lanterns, exposed roots joined to rocks, flowers and sitting nook. Located west of pond. Scale person.')
add('09_GiantTree','GIANTTREE','BASE_AND_SILHOUETTE','Tree roots and modeling silhouette','SM_BH_GiantTree','Same tree: base closeup roots and bench/hidden collectible recess; front silhouette; side silhouette. Three main boughs and crown widths preserved. Useful modeling sheet.')
add('10_Pond','POND','MASTER','Central pond and arena master','BP_BH_FishingZone,L_Bellheart','46x34m irregular turquoise basin, village north, tree northwest, open22x18m flat eastern arena, southern tutorial bank, west waterfall outlet. Three-quarter from southeast, full shoreline readable, fish silhouettes in water, access gaps in fence.')
add('10_Pond','POND','NORTH_SOUTH_BANKS','Pond access bank views','BP_BH_FishingZone','Two matched bank views: from south fishing bank north toward village/tower; from north bank south toward arrival bridge. Rounded pale shoreline rocks, clear standing ledges, same pond.')
add('10_Pond','POND','WATERFALL_ARENA','Waterfall outlet and Bellcrab emergence bay','BP_BH_FishingZone,BP_BH_BellcrabArena','Two panels: west outlet waterfall from6m water surface to-18m airborne cascade; eastern 22x18m arena, clear emergence ramp, two broad retreat routes, sparse edge vegetation. No giant boulders blocking combat.')
characters=[('ORIN','Elder Orin','174cm elderly lean man, long silver brows, short forked beard, warm thoughtful eyes, teal long waistcoat over cream shirt, umber trousers and boots, bronze bell pendant, rolled chart.'),('MIRA','Mira','168cm adult woman, warm brown skin, curly auburn hair in short practical braid, alert friendly eyes, teal bandana, cream rolled sleeves, fitted teal vest, ochre sash, brown boots, bait pouch and net basket.'),('BRAM','Bram','190cm broad adult craftsman, warm tan skin, thick swept dark hair, full square dark beard, friendly eyes and nose, cream rolled sleeves, dark brown leather apron with split-bell patch, bronze buckles, strong hands.'),('TAVI','Tavi','172cm young adult villager, slim build, olive skin, short wavy black hair, freckles, cheerful face, mustard short jacket, teal scarf, cream undershirt, patched brown trousers, satchel and small brass telescope.')]
