add('12_Fish','FISH','STYLE_MASTER','Fish family design language','DA_BH_FishSpecies','Studio fish family sheet. Six distinct species: Cloudfin silver-blue round body with broad cloudlike fins; Pebble Carp moss olive deep body stone-like scale plates; Lantern Minnow tiny teal amber luminous throat; Silver Snapper sleek silver angular jaw and red-gold fins; Stonejaw broad slate head ochre dorsal; Golden Cloudfin exactly same body as Cloudfin with golden colors. Readable natural eyes, selective broad scales, stylized not realistic. Side silhouettes and head/fin/scale treatment.')
